flowchart TB
    subgraph INTAKE[Intake and preparation]
        FORM[Google Form] --> CONNECTOR[Apps Script and tracking Sheet]
        CONNECTOR --> DRAFT[HandoffCheck draft]
        APP[Direct app request] --> DRAFT
        DRAFT --> READY[Author confirms fields and assigns two leads]
    end
    READY --> REVIEW[Explicit submission or manual review]
    subgraph ASSIST[AI assistance with human acceptance]
        REVIEW --> CHECK{Required fields recorded}
        CHECK -->|Yes| AI[AI language review]
        CHECK -->|No| AUTHOR
        AI --> FINDINGS[Questions and source-linked findings]
        FINDINGS --> AUTHOR[Author answers and accepts edits]
        AUTHOR --> VERSION[Save new revision]
        VERSION --> REVIEW
        FINDINGS --> CLEAR[Current review ready and blockers resolved]
    end
    subgraph APPROVAL[Human approval]
        CLEAR --> PRODUCT[Assigned product lead approves]
        CLEAR --> ENGINEERING[Assigned engineering lead approves]
        PRODUCT --> BOTH[Both approve the same revision]
        ENGINEERING --> BOTH
    end
    subgraph HANDOFF[Approved handoff]
        BOTH --> BRIEF[Deterministic stored brief]
        BRIEF --> MD[Markdown for existing engineering tools]
        BRIEF --> DOC[Apps Script private Google Doc export]
        BRIEF --> QA[Optional AI QA draft for human review]
        MD --> BUILD[Developers implement and QA tests]
        QA --> BUILD
    end
